---
import { sitePath } from "../lib/url";
---

<section class="cta-banner" aria-labelledby="cta-banner-heading">
  <div class="site-wrap py-2xl lg:py-3xl">
    <h2 id="cta-banner-heading" class="type-h2">
      Finally, something thoughtfully made.
    </h2>
    <p class="type-body mt-md max-w-prose">
      Explore printable learning resources and curated collections for curious
      children, across history, science, mathematics, the seasons and the wider
      world. Free resources are made with the same care as everything else.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-xl flex flex-wrap items-center gap-md">
      <a class="btn-primary" href={sitePath("/resources/")}>Browse the Library</a>
      <a class="btn-quiet" href={sitePath("/resources/?type=free")}>Get a Free Resource</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
